@lang en
IMPORT `pc-travel-part4-rental-car`

-- EN ≠ VI: every place where the English and the Vietnamese texts give different answers, one
-- scenario asserted against each reading (NOTES.md §4, findings VN-F1 to VN-F20). Each block
-- has at least one control on which the two agree. The expected values were worked from the
-- two quotations cited in the rule module, before the rules were run.

§ `VN-F1 — clause 5.7, flying`
-- A passenger who did not pay, in a licensed aircraft not run by a recognized airline.
#ASSERT `clause 5.7 excludes an accident whilst engaging in, reading the English` (`entering, descending or flying in an aircraft` TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `clause 5.7 excludes an accident whilst engaging in, reading the Vietnamese` (`entering, descending or flying in an aircraft` TRUE FALSE FALSE)
-- A fare-paying passenger in a licensed aircraft of an airline that is not recognized.
#ASSERT `clause 5.7 excludes an accident whilst engaging in, reading the English` (`entering, descending or flying in an aircraft` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `clause 5.7 excludes an accident whilst engaging in, reading the Vietnamese` (`entering, descending or flying in an aircraft` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
-- Control: fare-paying, unlicensed, unrecognized, excluded by both; fare-paying, licensed,
-- recognized, excluded by neither.
#ASSERT `clause 5.7 excludes an accident whilst engaging in, reading the English` (`entering, descending or flying in an aircraft` FALSE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT `clause 5.7 excludes an accident whilst engaging in, reading the Vietnamese` (`entering, descending or flying in an aircraft` FALSE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `clause 5.7 excludes an accident whilst engaging in, reading the English` (`entering, descending or flying in an aircraft` TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `clause 5.7 excludes an accident whilst engaging in, reading the Vietnamese` (`entering, descending or flying in an aircraft` TRUE TRUE TRUE)
-- End to end: medical expenses for an Injury in a private flight.
`an Injury on a private flight` MEANS
    `a Disability from` `the facts of an Injury` `on` (YMD 2026 4 5) `arising from` (LIST `an accident whilst engaging in` (`entering, descending or flying in an aircraft` TRUE FALSE FALSE))
`three expenses on 6 April` MEANS
    LIST `an expense of` `hospitalization` 10_000_000 `on` (YMD 2026 4 6)
       , `an expense of` `hospital room and board, charged on a per diem basis` 8_000_000 `on` (YMD 2026 4 6)
       , `an expense of` `consultation by registered doctors` 2_000_000 `on` (YMD 2026 4 6)
#ASSERT `1A — the amount payable` `the English text` `the test case` (`a Medical Expenses claim for` `an Injury on a private flight` `of` `three expenses on 6 April` `unable to return` FALSE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `1A — the amount payable` `the Vietnamese text` `the test case` (`a Medical Expenses claim for` `an Injury on a private flight` `of` `three expenses on 6 April` `unable to return` FALSE) EQUALS 18_000_000

§ `VN-F2 — clause 5.3, a riot that is not a popular rising`
#ASSERT NOT `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the English` (`mutiny, riot or civil commotion` FALSE)
#ASSERT `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the Vietnamese` (`mutiny, riot or civil commotion` FALSE)
#ASSERT `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the English` (`mutiny, riot or civil commotion` TRUE)
#ASSERT `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the Vietnamese` (`mutiny, riot or civil commotion` TRUE)
`an Injury in a street riot` MEANS
    `a Disability from` `the facts of an Injury` `on` (YMD 2026 4 5) `arising from` (LIST `mutiny, riot or civil commotion` FALSE)
#ASSERT `1A — the amount payable` `the English text` `the test case` (`a Medical Expenses claim for` `an Injury in a street riot` `of` `three expenses on 6 April` `unable to return` FALSE) EQUALS 18_000_000
#ASSERT `1A — the amount payable` `the Vietnamese text` `the test case` (`a Medical Expenses claim for` `an Injury in a street riot` `of` `three expenses on 6 April` `unable to return` FALSE) EQUALS 0

§ `VN-F3 — clause 5.7, climbing`
-- A climb that normally needs ropes, done without them; and an easy scramble done roped.
#ASSERT `clause 5.7 excludes an accident whilst engaging in, reading the English` (`rock or mountain climbing` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `clause 5.7 excludes an accident whilst engaging in, reading the Vietnamese` (`rock or mountain climbing` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `clause 5.7 excludes an accident whilst engaging in, reading the English` (`rock or mountain climbing` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT `clause 5.7 excludes an accident whilst engaging in, reading the Vietnamese` (`rock or mountain climbing` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT `clause 5.7 excludes an accident whilst engaging in, reading the English` (`rock or mountain climbing` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT `clause 5.7 excludes an accident whilst engaging in, reading the Vietnamese` (`rock or mountain climbing` TRUE TRUE)

§ `VN-F4 — clause 8, the 180 days of an extension`
GIVEN trip    IS A NUMBER
      insured IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A request to extend the cover`
`an extension asked on 15 April, a trip of` trip `days, insured for` insured MEANS
    `A request to extend the cover` WITH
        `date of asking`                                          IS YMD 2026 4 15
        `actively being treated or under the supervision of a Physician or Surgeon at the time of asking` IS FALSE
        `total length of the trip in days`                        IS trip
        `total days insured, the extension included`              IS insured
#ASSERT NOT `clause 8 — extension will be granted` `the English text` `the test Certificate` (`an extension asked on 15 April, a trip of` 200 `days, insured for` 170)
#ASSERT `clause 8 — extension will be granted` `the Vietnamese text` `the test Certificate` (`an extension asked on 15 April, a trip of` 200 `days, insured for` 170)
#ASSERT `clause 8 — extension will be granted` `the English text` `the test Certificate` (`an extension asked on 15 April, a trip of` 170 `days, insured for` 190)
#ASSERT NOT `clause 8 — extension will be granted` `the Vietnamese text` `the test Certificate` (`an extension asked on 15 April, a trip of` 170 `days, insured for` 190)
#ASSERT `clause 8 — extension will be granted` `the English text` `the test Certificate` (`an extension asked on 15 April, a trip of` 100 `days, insured for` 100)
#ASSERT `clause 8 — extension will be granted` `the Vietnamese text` `the test Certificate` (`an extension asked on 15 April, a trip of` 100 `days, insured for` 100)

§ `VN-F5 and VN-F10 — 1B.4, the Hospital Cash Allowance`
-- 36 hours across two calendar days: one complete day (English), two days (Vietnamese).
#ASSERT `1B.4 — the Hospital Cash Allowance` `the English text` `the test case` `an Illness on 5 April` (`a stay of` 36 `hours over` 2 `calendar days, acute` TRUE `, documentation satisfactory to the Company` TRUE) EQUALS 1_000_000
#ASSERT `1B.4 — the Hospital Cash Allowance` `the Vietnamese text` `the test case` `an Illness on 5 April` (`a stay of` 36 `hours over` 2 `calendar days, acute` TRUE `, documentation satisfactory to the Company` TRUE) EQUALS 2_000_000
-- Control: 72 hours over 3 calendar days is 3,000,000 either way.
#ASSERT `1B.4 — the Hospital Cash Allowance` `the English text` `the test case` `an Illness on 5 April` (`a stay of` 72 `hours over` 3 `calendar days, acute` TRUE `, documentation satisfactory to the Company` TRUE) EQUALS 3_000_000
#ASSERT `1B.4 — the Hospital Cash Allowance` `the Vietnamese text` `the test case` `an Illness on 5 April` (`a stay of` 72 `hours over` 3 `calendar days, acute` TRUE `, documentation satisfactory to the Company` TRUE) EQUALS 3_000_000
-- VN-F10: documents produced, not to the Company's satisfaction.
#ASSERT `1B.4 — the Hospital Cash Allowance` `the English text` `the test case` `an Illness on 5 April` (`a stay of` 72 `hours over` 3 `calendar days, acute` TRUE `, documentation satisfactory to the Company` FALSE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `1B.4 — the Hospital Cash Allowance` `the Vietnamese text` `the test case` `an Illness on 5 April` (`a stay of` 72 `hours over` 3 `calendar days, acute` TRUE `, documentation satisfactory to the Company` FALSE) EQUALS 3_000_000

§ `VN-F6 — Immediate Family Members: an adoptive parent`
#ASSERT `the relation is an Immediate Family Member` `the English text` `adoptive parent`
#ASSERT NOT `the relation is an Immediate Family Member` `the Vietnamese text` `adoptive parent`
#ASSERT `the relation is an Immediate Family Member` `the English text` `natural parent`
#ASSERT `the relation is an Immediate Family Member` `the Vietnamese text` `natural parent`
`the adoptive mother` MEANS `the Insured Person's` `adoptive parent`
GIVEN who IS A `A person related to the Insured Person`
GIVETH A `A section 8 claim`
`a curtailment on 10 April because of the death of` who MEANS
    `a section 8 claim for` `curtailment of the trip` `because of` (`death, Serious Injury or Illness afflicting` who) `, a death` TRUE `, findings` `findings that are not serious` `, the cause arising on` (YMD 2026 4 10) `, known at issue` FALSE `, disaster after commencement` FALSE `, prepaid` 20_000_000 `, unused` 0.5 `, extra` 15_000_000
-- Section 8: the adoptive mother dies and the trip is cut short.
#ASSERT `8 — the amount payable` `the English text` `the test case` (`a curtailment on 10 April because of the death of` `the adoptive mother`) EQUALS 25_000_000
#ASSERT `8 — the amount payable` `the Vietnamese text` `the test case` (`a curtailment on 10 April because of the death of` `the adoptive mother`) EQUALS 0
-- Section 9(ii)(a): a liability to the adoptive mother.
#ASSERT `9 — the amount payable` `the English text` `the test case` (`a liability for` `accidental bodily injury to a third party` `arising from` (LIST `liability to an Immediate Family Member` `the adoptive mother`) `, judgement` `no judgement` `, damages` 300_000_000) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `9 — the amount payable` `the Vietnamese text` `the test case` (`a liability for` `accidental bodily injury to a third party` `arising from` (LIST `liability to an Immediate Family Member` `the adoptive mother`) `, judgement` `no judgement` `, damages` 300_000_000) EQUALS 370_000_000
-- Section 1B.6: the adoptive mother visits the Insured Person in hospital.
`the adoptive mother's visit` MEANS
    LIST `a cost of` `economy class travel` 20_000_000 `incurred by` (JUST `the adoptive mother`)
       , `a cost of` `accommodation` 15_000_000 `incurred by` (JUST `the adoptive mother`)
#ASSERT `1B.6 — the amount payable` `the English text` `the test case` `an Illness on 5 April` (`a stay of` 121 `hours over` 6 `calendar days, acute` TRUE `, documentation satisfactory to the Company` TRUE) FALSE `the adoptive mother` `the adoptive mother's visit` EQUALS 35_000_000
#ASSERT `1B.6 — the amount payable` `the Vietnamese text` `the test case` `an Illness on 5 April` (`a stay of` 121 `hours over` 6 `calendar days, acute` TRUE `, documentation satisfactory to the Company` TRUE) FALSE `the adoptive mother` `the adoptive mother's visit` EQUALS 0

§ `VN-F7 — 1B.7, Return of Children after an Illness that is not serious`
`the children's journey home` MEANS
    LIST `a cost of` `economy class travel` 15_000_000 `incurred by` NOTHING
       , `a cost of` `economy class travel` 15_000_000 `incurred by` NOTHING
       , `a cost of` `accommodation` 10_000_000 `incurred by` NOTHING
#ASSERT `1B.7 — the amount payable` `the English text` `the test case` `an Illness on 5 April` `an Illness that is not serious` TRUE TRUE `the children's journey home` EQUALS 40_000_000
#ASSERT `1B.7 — the amount payable` `the Vietnamese text` `the test case` `an Illness on 5 April` `an Illness that is not serious` TRUE TRUE `the children's journey home` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `1B.7 — the amount payable` `the English text` `the test case` `an Illness on 5 April` `a Serious Illness` TRUE TRUE `the children's journey home` EQUALS 40_000_000
#ASSERT `1B.7 — the amount payable` `the Vietnamese text` `the test case` `an Illness on 5 April` `a Serious Illness` TRUE TRUE `the children's journey home` EQUALS 40_000_000

