#ASSERT `3 — the amount payable` `the English text` `the test case` (`clothing damaged in a mishandled bag, of kind` `a suitcase, bag or other luggage container`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `3 — the amount payable` `the Vietnamese text` `the test case` (`clothing damaged in a mishandled bag, of kind` `a suitcase, bag or other luggage container`) EQUALS 0

§ `VN-F9 — 1B.9, Referral Services: may, or will`
