§ `VN-F11 — section 5, the perils and the 24 hours`
-- A passport mislaid: "accidental loss" in English, not "tai nạn" in Vietnamese.
#ASSERT `5 — the amount payable` `the English text` `the test case` (`a passport lost by` `accidental loss without an Accident` `, reported after` (JUST 10) `hours, as soon as practicable` TRUE `, left unattended` FALSE) EQUALS 15_000_000
#ASSERT `5 — the amount payable` `the Vietnamese text` `the test case` (`a passport lost by` `accidental loss without an Accident` `, reported after` (JUST 10) `hours, as soon as practicable` TRUE `, left unattended` FALSE) EQUALS 0
-- Reported after 30 hours, which was as soon as practicable.
#ASSERT `5 — the amount payable` `the English text` `the test case` (`a passport lost by` `theft` `, reported after` (JUST 30) `hours, as soon as practicable` TRUE `, left unattended` FALSE) EQUALS 15_000_000
#ASSERT `5 — the amount payable` `the Vietnamese text` `the test case` (`a passport lost by` `theft` `, reported after` (JUST 30) `hours, as soon as practicable` TRUE `, left unattended` FALSE) EQUALS 0
-- Control: a theft reported in 10 hours.
#ASSERT `5 — the amount payable` `the English text` `the test case` (`a passport lost by` `theft` `, reported after` (JUST 10) `hours, as soon as practicable` TRUE `, left unattended` FALSE) EQUALS 15_000_000
#ASSERT `5 — the amount payable` `the Vietnamese text` `the test case` (`a passport lost by` `theft` `, reported after` (JUST 10) `hours, as soon as practicable` TRUE `, left unattended` FALSE) EQUALS 15_000_000

§ `VN-F12 — Eligible Expenses: where the customary charge is measured`
-- Treatment abroad costing 12 million, customary there; the customary charge in the country
-- where the bill was paid is 8 million.
#ASSERT `the eligible amount of` `the English text` (`an expense of` `surgery` 12_000_000 `against customary charges of` 12_000_000 `where incurred and` 8_000_000 `where paid`) EQUALS 12_000_000
#ASSERT `the eligible amount of` `the Vietnamese text` (`an expense of` `surgery` 12_000_000 `against customary charges of` 12_000_000 `where incurred and` 8_000_000 `where paid`) EQUALS 8_000_000
#ASSERT `1A — the amount payable` `the English text` `the test case` (`a Medical Expenses claim for` `an Illness on 5 April` `of` (LIST `an expense of` `surgery` 12_000_000 `against customary charges of` 12_000_000 `where incurred and` 8_000_000 `where paid`) `unable to return` FALSE) EQUALS 12_000_000
#ASSERT `1A — the amount payable` `the Vietnamese text` `the test case` (`a Medical Expenses claim for` `an Illness on 5 April` `of` (LIST `an expense of` `surgery` 12_000_000 `against customary charges of` 12_000_000 `where incurred and` 8_000_000 `where paid`) `unable to return` FALSE) EQUALS 8_000_000

§ `VN-F13 — 9(ii)(h), firearms or weapons`
GIVEN v  IS A `Text version`
      cs IS A LIST OF `A circumstance named in section 9(ii)`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`9 pays for an injury arising from` v cs MEANS
    `9 — the amount payable` v `the test case` (`a liability for` `accidental bodily injury to a third party` `arising from` cs `, judgement` `no judgement` `, damages` 300_000_000)
#ASSERT `9 pays for an injury arising from` `the English text` (LIST `the use of a weapon` FALSE) EQUALS 370_000_000
#ASSERT `9 pays for an injury arising from` `the Vietnamese text` (LIST `the use of a weapon` FALSE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `9 pays for an injury arising from` `the English text` (LIST `the use of a weapon` TRUE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `9 pays for an injury arising from` `the Vietnamese text` (LIST `the use of a weapon` TRUE) EQUALS 0

§ `VN-F15 — clause 17, a right of action before an award`
`a difference with no award yet` MEANS
    `A difference with the Company` WITH
        `requires medical knowledge`                              IS FALSE
        `the parties agreed on a single arbitrator`               IS TRUE
        `an award has been determined`                            IS FALSE
`a difference with an award` MEANS
    `A difference with the Company` WITH
        `requires medical knowledge`                              IS FALSE
        `the parties agreed on a single arbitrator`               IS TRUE
        `an award has been determined`                            IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `clause 17 — a right of action against the Company exists, reading the English` `a difference with no award yet`
#ASSERT REFUSED `clause 17 — a right of action against the Company exists, reading the Vietnamese` `a difference with no award yet`
#ASSERT `clause 17 — a right of action against the Company exists, reading the English` `a difference with an award`
#ASSERT `clause 17 — a right of action against the Company exists, reading the Vietnamese` `a difference with an award`

§ `VN-F17 — section 10, a return home`
`the 31-day case` MEANS `the test case under` (`a Certificate for` `Plan A` `a product the wording does not name` `from` (YMD 2026 4 1) `to` (YMD 2026 5 1) `with` `the limits in the test Certificate`)
-- An unexpected return for 7 days: allowed by both; cover after going back out: English no,
-- Vietnamese yes.
#ASSERT `10 — the return is one the section allows, reading the English` `the 31-day case` (`a return home for` 7 `days, for medical treatment` FALSE `, for an unexpected reason` TRUE)
#ASSERT `10 — the return is one the section allows, reading the Vietnamese` `the 31-day case` (`a return home for` 7 `days, for medical treatment` FALSE `, for an unexpected reason` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `10.5 — cover resumes when the trip resumes` `the English text` `the 31-day case` (`a return home for` 7 `days, for medical treatment` FALSE `, for an unexpected reason` TRUE)
#ASSERT `10.5 — cover resumes when the trip resumes` `the Vietnamese text` `the 31-day case` (`a return home for` 7 `days, for medical treatment` FALSE `, for an unexpected reason` TRUE)
-- A planned visit home: "incidental" in English; not "vì lý do đột xuất" in Vietnamese.
#ASSERT `10 — the return is one the section allows, reading the English` `the 31-day case` (`a return home for` 7 `days, for medical treatment` FALSE `, for an unexpected reason` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `10 — the return is one the section allows, reading the Vietnamese` `the 31-day case` (`a return home for` 7 `days, for medical treatment` FALSE `, for an unexpected reason` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `10.5 — cover resumes when the trip resumes` `the Vietnamese text` `the 31-day case` (`a return home for` 7 `days, for medical treatment` FALSE `, for an unexpected reason` FALSE)

§ `VN-F18 — sections 11 and 12, a licensed rental company that is not "recognized"`
`a licensed company nobody has recognized` MEANS `a rental company, licensed` TRUE `, recognized` FALSE
#ASSERT `11 — the amount payable` `the English text` `the test case` (`an excess of` 8_000_000 `, renting from` `a licensed company nobody has recognized` `, off a public road` FALSE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `11 — the amount payable` `the Vietnamese text` `the test case` (`an excess of` 8_000_000 `, renting from` `a licensed company nobody has recognized` `, off a public road` FALSE) EQUALS 8_000_000
#ASSERT `12 — the amount payable unless the Company refuses` `the English text` `the test case` (`rental car damage by` `collision` `to` `a car` `from` `a licensed company nobody has recognized` `of` 50_000_000 `, papers submitted` TRUE `, intoxicated` FALSE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `12 — the amount payable unless the Company refuses` `the Vietnamese text` `the test case` (`rental car damage by` `collision` `to` `a car` `from` `a licensed company nobody has recognized` `of` 50_000_000 `, papers submitted` TRUE `, intoxicated` FALSE) EQUALS 45_000_000
-- Control: an unlicensed company fails both.
#ASSERT `11 — the amount payable` `the Vietnamese text` `the test case` (`an excess of` 8_000_000 `, renting from` (`a rental company, licensed` FALSE `, recognized` TRUE) `, off a public road` FALSE) EQUALS 0
